From: stefan <46031448+StefanPetersTM@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 23 Jul 2026 16:21:24 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] rf: add opt-in M2SDR primer transport controls

The CP2985/CP3114 phone chain requires bounded Soapy timing and stream-state accommodations before handing the live core from the primer RAN to OCUDU. Keep the transport behavior default-off so ordinary srsRAN radio semantics remain unchanged.
---
 lib/src/phy/rf/rf_soapy_imp.c | 151 ++++++++++++++++++++++++----------
 lib/src/radio/radio.cc        |  16 +++-
 2 files changed, 123 insertions(+), 44 deletions(-)

